    "TPS62933F": "TI SLUSEA4D (https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps62933f.pdf): IHS_LIMIT 4.2/5/5.8 A, ILS_LIMIT 2.9/3.8/4.5 A, ISS 4.5/5.5/6.5 uA, tSS = CSS x 0.8 V / ISS, OVP 112/115/118 %, UVP 65 % + 256 us then hiccup 10.5 x tSS, VFB 784-816 mV (-40..150 C), Table 10-2 effective COUT, Eq. 21",
    "LMR38020": "TI SNVSC40E (https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/lmr38020.pdf): IHS 2.6/3.2/3.8 A, ILS 1.8/2.3/2.8 A, tSS 4 ms, OCP blanking 18 ms typ at power-up, hiccup 76 ms, COUT <= ~10 x design value or 1000 uF",
    "TPS1663": "TI SLVSET9G (https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps1663.pdf): tSD(dly) SHDN -> FET off 0.8-1.5 us, I(dVdT) 1.775/2/2.225 uA, GAIN(dVdT) 23.5/25/26",
    "TPS3808": "TI SBVS050N (https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps3808.pdf): delay (s) = CT (nF) / 175 + 0.5 ms; open-CT delay 12/20/28 ms (+-40 %)",
    "TPS7A16": "TI SBVS171F (https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps7a16.pdf): overall accuracy +-2 %",
    "LM2901": "TI SLCS006Z (https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/lm2901.pdf): VIO 7 mV (25 C) / 15 mV (-40..125 C), input bias -500 nA, common mode 0..VCC-2 V (one input in range gives a proper output state)",
    "SMAJ5.0A": "JLC/LCSC C113952 listing (MDD): VRWM 5.0 V, VBR 6.4-7.0 V class, VC 9.2 V at 43.5 A (10/1000 us), IR <= 800 uA at VRWM",
